 re we invite members and the public to share their ideas and projects with
  one another. It's an excellent place to learn more about who we are\, and
  meet new artisans and makers in an inspiring environment. No need to regi
 ster - All are welcome to show up! All non-member visitors are welcome and
  must be buzzed in via the front door call box. For directions and parking
  info\, click here.\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page
 : https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/open-hack/21380/
