BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intro to Watercolor
DTSTART:20260408T000000
DTEND:20260408T020000
DTSTAMP:20261030T171909Z
UID:b475183987fc5e042b7455d15bb90a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:In this six-week introduction to watercolor\, we’ll navigate
  the distinct challenges and techniques of watercolor painting through a s
 eries of exercises and mini projects – leading up to a full scale painti
 ng. This is very beginner focused and allows time for hands-on instruction
 . The areas of focus for the classes are: -The differences and common lang
 uage to know when choosing your materials. -How to achieve different washe
 s and manage the amount of water on your paper. -Color theory basics and h
 ow that translates to a transparent medium. -Embracing the medium's unique
  properties by creating textures with salt\, alcohol\, and masking\n\nSour
 ces: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentr
 alma.org/event/intro-to-watercolor/29109/
LOCATION:Worcester Center for Crafts\, 25 Sagamore Rd.\, Worcester\, MA\, 
 01605
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/intro-to-watercolor/29109/
END:VEVENT
