DTEND:20260820T183000
DTSTAMP:20261030T171909Z
UID:107598c3340320f7220ba4966ddddd@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join world-renowned sleight-of-hand magician Benjamin Levy for
  a one-of-a-kind evening of magic\, mind reading\, miracles\, and more at 
 the historic Red Lion Inn in Stockbridge\, MA. In this elegant and exclusi
 ve show\, you’ll witness the impossible—up close and personal. Magic w
 ill happen right in your own hands. Your thoughts will be read (only if yo
 u wish!)\, and you’ll experience wonders unlike anything you’ve seen b
