 tle\, slow movement\, with long relaxing holds. Supported by bolsters and 
 pillows\, you ease your body. Unwinding slowly\, you find deep release.Ton
 al sound bowls may be played\, creating calm as you breathe and relax. No 
 experience necessary. This class is for all ages and all abilities and can
  be done while sitting in a chair or on a mat on the floor. Please feel fr
 ee to bring a blanket and water bottle and wear comfortable clothing. You 
 may like a comfy eye mask for the tonal relaxation.\n\nSources: Discover C
 entral Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/
