 s open their studios and artwork for the public to enjoy\, buy and also cr
 eate! Here at 14 Cedar Street Studios\, we have over 20+ artists\, Kaha Co
 ffee\, Kitchen Local and all kinds of musical artists. Our studio will be 
 buzzing with action November 14th from 10-5pm and November 15th from 11-4p
 m. FREE trolley provided by the amazing Amesbury Cultural Council will bri
 ng you around town to all the stops.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent pa
