DESCRIPTION:Jay Larson is a true professional. He’s performed on Conan f
 our times\, has performed on Comedy Central\, HBO and Showtime\, he has th
 ree hour specials\, a new special coming out in December\, he’s acted wi
 th Larry David\, Amy Schumer and Amy Poehler and is in the New season of R
 ooster starring Steve Carell. And if that isn’t enough you probably know
  his “Wrong Number” joke because it’s been seen almost a billion tim
