SUMMARY:Lynn Open Studios
DTSTART:20261121T100000
DTEND:20261122T160000
DTSTAMP:20261030T171909Z
UID:22fc221a940423e092d3c59ebaf36a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE city-wide Open Studios event\, a rare oppor
 tunity for the public to visit artist studios and see incredible\, unique 
 work across two iconic locations. Visit the historic Lydia Pinkham Buildin
 g\, home to dozens of working fine artists\, craftspeople\, and creative m
 akers across multiple floors. In the heart of Downtown Lynn\, check out Th
 e Studio at Lynn Museum & Arts Center to meet local creators\, see their s
 tudios\, and shop their artisan and vendor market. Both locations will hav
 e incredible art available for purchase. Admission is completely free. All
  are welcome! Whether you’re looking to purchase original art\, support 
 local creators\, or enjoy a day seeing something new\, Lynn Open Studios o
 ffers something for everyone. Lydia Pinkham Open Studios Sat Nov 21 10am-5
 pm\, Sun Nov 21 11am-4pm 271 Western Ave\, Lynn\, MA 01904 Meet local crea
 tors\, purchase original artwork\, and get a peak behind the scenes to dis
 cover the process behind their art. Painting\, pottery\, leather work\, je
 welry\, glass blowing and more! The Studios at Lynn Museum & Art Center Sa
 t Nov 21 10am-5pm\, Sun Nov 21 11am-4pm 25 Exchange St\, Lynn\, MA 01901 E
 xplore multiple floors of creative spaces featuring local painters\, music
 ians\, mixed-media artists\, and photographers! Artwork will be available 
 for purchase.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofbost
 on.org/event/lynn-open-studios/
LOCATION:Lydia Pinkham Building\, 271 Western Ave\, Lynn\, MA\, 01904
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/lynn-open-studios/
END:VEVENT
