 aged from the grounds of Stevens-Coolidge Discover how to mix textures\, s
 hapes\, and shades of green for a lush\, dimensional look Incorporate pine
 cones\, berries\, dried orange slices\, cinnamon sticks\, and more Choose 
 from festive ribbon to personalize your wreath Leave with a handcrafted ho
 liday wreath perfect for your door\, mantel\, or as a heartfelt gift We wi
 ll provide participants with one 12″ wreath frame per registration. We w
 ill also provide wire and all decorating materials to construct your wreat
 h. We recommend bringing a pair of gardening gloves and garden shears/scis
 sors for handling tougher plant materials! Pre-registration Is required. T
 his program is rain or shine! In the event of cancellation\, you will be n
 otified via the email address you used to register and refunded in full wi
