DTEND:20261212T140000
DTSTAMP:20261030T171909Z
UID:cbced122dcd935c9b9c5934b50ba83@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:New England Equine Rescue (NEER North) is throwing open the ba
 rn doors and welcoming our supporters and the community for the annual Hol
 iday Open House on Saturday\, December 12th from 11-2 PM. Join us at 52 As
 h Street in West Newbury\, MA to visit the horses and donkeys in their hol
 iday finery\, browse the used tack shop\, enjoy seasonal treats\, purchase
