BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Beautiful Losers — A Tribute to Bob Seger & The Silver Bulle
 t Band
DTSTART:20270116T200000
DTEND:20270116T200000
DTSTAMP:20261030T171909Z
UID:c5b379768b0cefe45de1c00a7a620b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:With an all-star cast of players\, The Beautiful Losers have t
 aken America by storm with their incredible tribute to the music of Bob Se
 ger & The Silver Bullet Band. You will hear ALL the hits plus live showsto
 ppers that Bob and his band made famous during this amazing night of music
  with The Beautiful Losers. Devin Cordeiro – Lead Vocals (Last Laugh) Da
 vid Stefanelli – Drums (Robert Ellis Orrall\, RTZ w/ Brad Delp & Barry G
 oudreau formerly of the band BOSTON\, Peter Wolf’s Houseparty 5 of J. Ge
 ils Band\, Sully Erna of Godsmack) David Ayotte – Sax\, Vocals (The Cont
 inentals) Carl Ayotte – Sax\, Guitar\, Vocals (All Summer Long\, Captain
  Morgan & The Rum Runners) Steve Baker – Keyboards (BeatleJuice w/ Brad 
 Delp of BOSTON\, Fortune\, Ben Orr of The Cars) Nate Comp – Guitar\, Voc
 als (Craving Lucy\, Rotten Apple) Kevin Elder – Bass (Last Laugh\, Groov
 e Alliance) Bill Plourde – Guitar\, Vocals (Fortune\, Tangerine)\n\nSour
 ces: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/the-beau
 tiful-losers-a-tribute-to-bob-seger-the-silver-bullet-band/
